OL,3,ATwo killed in 'massive' Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Aattack on Moscow region, Russia says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two people have been killed
OL,7,Fand six injured in a "massive"
OL,8,Fovernight Ukrainian drone attack on the
OL,9,FMoscow region, Governor Andrei Vorobyev
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FMoscow Mayor Sergei Sobyanin said 450
OL,13,Fdrones heading for the capital had been
OL,14,Fshot down in what he called an
OL,15,F"unprecedented attack". An oil refinery
OL,16,Fwas damaged and several homes were set
OL,17,Fablaze.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
