OL,3,ATwo killed in 'massive' Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Aattack on Moscow region, Russia says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fconfirmed Kyiv had hit a "key" Russian
OL,8,Foil facility and a logistics site in
OL,9,Fthe region, representing "billions of
OL,10,Fdollars that sustain the war machine".
OL,12,FUkrainian officials meanwhile said
OL,13,Feight people, including three children,
OL,14,Fhad been killed in Russian attacks in
OL,15,Fthe Kyiv and Sumy regions on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
